    "mission": {
      "type": "thh-about-mission",
      "settings": {
        "title": "Our Mission",
        "lead": "Allow The Healthy Hand to be a Helping Hand",
        "text": "<p>Our mission is to promote health and wellness by encouraging habits of a healthier life style, increase awareness of factors and resources contributing to well-being, inspiring and empowering individuals to take more responsibility for their own health.</p><p>We stand behind our products as well as our customers.</p>",
        "herbs": "<p>For countless years, people from various cultures have relied on medicinal plants for the mind, body, and spirit, dating back to 3000 BC.</p><p>Many herbs can be taken in tea form, which can often be just as effective as taking capsules. Some herbs are better taken in liquid or powder form.</p><p>Although herbs are relatively safe, they should be used with caution, as directed on products, and/or as directed by your doctor or physician.</p>",
